# Guest-agent listening ports (ADR 0015, capability 64), little-endian, one vector per line.
# LISTENERS event payloads: count, omitted, malformed, then entries of family, address,
# port, inode, pid, program length and program. WATCH_LISTENERS request payloads: one byte.
empty 000000000000000000000000
typical 
subscribe 01
unsubscribe 02
